WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Practice trading with virtual funds. No signup required.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.166
Choose Try the demo to open a sample practice workspace.

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:13.296
Search for Apple and enter two shares.

00:00:13.296 --> 00:00:17.340
Review the buy order and estimated cost.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.396
Confirm the buy. Two AAPL shares fill for $475.28.

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:26.648
Open Portfolio: 27 AAPL shares and $75,052.87 cash.

00:00:26.648 --> 00:00:31.834
Choose your Apple holding, then Sell one share.

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:35.770
Review the sell order and estimated credit.

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:39.706
Confirm the sell. One AAPL share fills for $237.53.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:45.372
Open Activity to see both completed trades.

00:00:45.372 --> 00:00:48.367
Try the demo at lot-trading-lab.vercel.app/demo. No signup.
